    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Calculate the dry weight of an organ for a single plant, based on its fresh weight and the dry matter content estimated on a sample. The organ may be for instance leaf (Lf), panicle (Pcle), main shoot stem (MnShoStm), internode (InterNod).</ns1:definition>
